<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15">
  <head>
    <metadata>
      <ttm:title>mosi mosi?</ttm:title>
      <ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">楽音</ttm:agent>
      <ttm:item type="album">mosi mosi?</ttm:item>
      <ttm:item type="spotify_id">76oCvJj6LRoed2754GybpH</ttm:item>
      <itunes:duration>02:44.000</itunes:duration>
    </metadata>
    <styling>
      <style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold"/>
      <style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic"/>
    </styling>
    <layout>
      <region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center"/>
    </layout>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:01.720" end="00:05.270" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ooh-ah, pa, pa, pa)</p>
      <p begin="00:05.270" end="00:08.660" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ooh-ah, pa, pa, pa)</p>
      <p begin="00:08.660" end="00:12.040" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ooh-ah, pa, pa, pa)</p>
      <p begin="00:12.040" end="00:16.260" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ooh-ah, pa, pa-pa-pa) pa, pa-pa, pa</p>
      <p begin="00:16.260" end="00:19.820" ttm:agent="v1">ないしらせは 良いしらせ^No news is good news</p>
      <p begin="00:19.820" end="00:22.860" ttm:agent="v1">南極しらせは お幸せ^The Antarctic *Shirase* brings happiness</p>
      <p begin="00:22.860" end="00:25.280" ttm:agent="v1">にっちもさっちもいかない^Stuck in a bind, nowhere to turn</p>
      <p begin="00:25.280" end="00:29.660" ttm:agent="v1">ニッチな気持ち とっ散らかってるの^A niche feeling—everything's scattered all over</p>
      <p begin="00:29.660" end="00:32.750" ttm:agent="v1">無我夢中 小宇宙^Lost in the moment, a microcosm</p>
      <p begin="00:32.750" end="00:36.230" ttm:agent="v1">交信中 君にちゅ^Communicating now—sending a kiss to you</p>
      <p begin="00:36.230" end="00:40.440" ttm:agent="v1">彷徨う 貴方様よ^Oh, you, wandering out there</p>
      <p begin="00:40.440" end="00:43.600" ttm:agent="v1">「もしもーし 聞こえてる？」^&quot;Hello? Can you hear me?&quot;</p>
      <p begin="00:43.600" end="00:46.580" ttm:agent="v1">電波 電波の怪電波^Radio waves—mysterious, strange signals</p>
      <p begin="00:46.580" end="00:50.440" ttm:agent="v1">宇宙に夢中で交信中^Lost in space, trying to make contact</p>
      <p begin="00:50.440" end="00:53.190" ttm:agent="v1">けんぱ けんぱで 1000メーター^Hop-scotching along, a thousand meters</p>
      <p begin="00:53.190" end="00:56.830" ttm:agent="v1">ネコに嫌われても ママに叱られても^Even if the cat hates me, even if Mom scolds me</p>
      <p begin="00:56.830" end="01:04.830" ttm:agent="v1">私と似合う あなたに出会うの^I’ll meet the one who’s perfect for me</p>
      <p begin="01:13.680" end="01:15.310" ttm:agent="v1">CQCQ どこなのエイリアン^CQ CQ—where are you, alien?</p>
      <p begin="01:15.310" end="01:17.160" ttm:agent="v1">シクシク 孤独なエリア^*Shiku-shiku*—sobbing in a lonely zone</p>
      <p begin="01:17.160" end="01:18.660" ttm:agent="v1">ウォーアイニー ハローハワユー？^*Wo ai ni*—hello, how are you?</p>
      <p begin="01:18.650" end="01:20.470" ttm:agent="v1">ラブアンドピース 波長が合う^Love and peace—we’re on the same wavelength</p>
      <p begin="01:20.470" end="01:21.970" ttm:agent="v1">うちからそこまで何光年？^How many light-years from here to there?</p>
      <p begin="01:21.920" end="01:23.750" ttm:agent="v1">てかそれとも隣の3丁目？^Or is it just the next block over?</p>
      <p begin="01:23.750" end="01:25.250" ttm:agent="v1">キャトったハートはいずこ？^Where did my heart go after being abducted?</p>
      <p begin="01:24.730" end="01:26.420" ttm:agent="v1">-QLO ダウンじゃ 宇宙は is it cold？^Uniqlo down jacket—is it cold out in space?</p>
      <p begin="01:26.420" end="01:29.540" ttm:agent="v1">なのにさ姿が 見当たんない^Yet, I can't catch a glimpse of you</p>
      <p begin="01:29.540" end="01:33.300" ttm:agent="v1">グレーな気持ちが 宙ぶらりん^My gray mood is left hanging in limbo</p>
      <p begin="01:33.300" end="01:36.200" ttm:agent="v1">見つけてやるぞ UFO^I’m gonna find you, UFO</p>
      <p begin="01:36.200" end="01:40.410" ttm:agent="v1">そんで会いたかったって 言うの^And then I’ll tell you I wanted to see you</p>
      <p begin="01:40.410" end="01:43.020" ttm:agent="v1">電波 電波 あっ圏外^Radio waves—oh no, out of range</p>
      <p begin="01:43.020" end="01:47.230" ttm:agent="v1">それでも 夢中で交信中^Still, I’m desperately trying to connect</p>
      <p begin="01:47.230" end="01:49.890" ttm:agent="v1">なんか変だよインベーダー^You’re acting weird, Invader</p>
      <p begin="01:49.890" end="01:53.780" ttm:agent="v1">君だけに注ぐ愛の^Pouring love out just for you</p>
      <p begin="01:53.780" end="01:56.470" ttm:agent="v1">電波 電波の怪電波^Radio waves—mysterious, strange signals</p>
      <p begin="01:56.470" end="02:00.450" ttm:agent="v1">宇宙に夢中で交信中^Lost in space, trying to make contact</p>
      <p begin="02:00.450" end="02:03.100" ttm:agent="v1">なんか変だよインベーダー^You’re acting weird, Invader</p>
      <p begin="02:03.100" end="02:07.030" ttm:agent="v1">君だけに捧ぐ愛を^Offering love just for you</p>
      <p begin="02:07.030" end="02:09.840" ttm:agent="v1">電波 電波 赤い電波^Radio waves—red signals</p>
      <p begin="02:09.840" end="02:13.860" ttm:agent="v1">リボンに包んで 送信中^Wrapped in a ribbon, transmitting now</p>
      <p begin="02:13.860" end="02:16.490" ttm:agent="v1">電波 電波 聞こえてるの？^Radio waves—can you hear me?</p>
      <p begin="02:16.490" end="02:20.380" ttm:agent="v1">心さらわれても 今 私の^Even if my heart gets stolen, I’ll meet the one</p>
      <p begin="02:20.380" end="02:25.410" ttm:agent="v1">私だけの あなたに出会うの^The one who belongs only to me</p>
      <p begin="02:25.410" end="02:28.990" ttm:agent="v1">Four season</p>
      <p begin="02:28.990" end="02:33.760" ttm:agent="v1">I miss you</p>
      <p begin="02:33.760" end="02:37.740" ttm:agent="v1">愛密集^Love is crowding in</p>
      <p begin="02:37.740" end="02:41.740" ttm:agent="v1"/>
    </div>
  </body>
</tt>
